  "name": "Local AI Visual Decision",
  "description": "Offline visual yes/no region decisions for a compatible Macro Handler 1.0.52 build. Install separate verified SmolVLM-256M (279 MB) or optional LFM2.5-VL-450M fast-profile data (322 MB) in block settings; LFM requires explicit license acceptance. No weights, APK/DEX/native libraries, API key or cloud fallback in this plugin. Existing region/prompt-variable and True/False/Unknown/Error actions are preserved. UI follows 14 app languages; English questions recommended. No calibrated confidence or object coordinates. Not a maths solver, exact pixel detector or universal game detector. Review the English GitHub guide and test on your screen.",
